WEBVTT

00:10:27.246 --> 00:10:31.162
This customer support job was perfect
for Janice, at least on paper.

00:10:31.662 --> 00:10:35.996
It offered room to grow personal
responsibility for managing a team and

00:10:35.996 --> 00:10:37.996
a culture of flexibility and freedom,

00:10:38.204 --> 00:10:42.537
I guess kind of be like invited into what
seemed like this like exclusive club

00:10:42.537 --> 00:10:44.787
of awesomeness.

00:10:45.204 --> 00:10:47.996
But pretty soon reality
crashed the party.

00:10:48.246 --> 00:10:52.704
I would say the honeymoon was over for
me when I went to a meetup and

00:10:52.704 --> 00:10:57.746
I found out that someone that I
had been interviewed by and

00:10:57.746 --> 00:10:59.787
I really admired had been let go.